<div class="ingredients-sidebar-title-template--23755308663113__ss_product_ingredients_7_3X8hYz">Artichoke Leaf</div>
<div class="ingredients-sidebar-subtext-template--23755308663113__ss_product_ingredients_7_3X8hYz"><p>Antioxidant</p></div>
<div class="ingredients-sidebar-image-template--23755308663113__ss_product_ingredients_7_3X8hYz">
<img height="1000" loading="eager" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 100vw, 100vw" src="//section.store/cdn/shop/files/146.jpg?v=1748284601&amp;width=1500" srcset="//section.store/cdn/shop/files/146.jpg?v=1748284601&amp;width=375 375w, //section.store/cdn/shop/files/146.jpg?v=1748284601&amp;width=550 550w, //section.store/cdn/shop/files/146.jpg?v=1748284601&amp;width=750 750w, //section.store/cdn/shop/files/146.jpg?v=1748284601&amp;width=1100 1100w, //section.store/cdn/shop/files/146.jpg?v=1748284601&amp;width=1500 1500w" width="1500"/>
</div>
<p class="ingredients-sidebar-heading-template--23755308663113__ss_product_ingredients_7_3X8hYz" style="border: 0px !important;">WHAT IS IT?</p>
<div class="ingredients-sidebar-text-template--23755308663113__ss_product_ingredients_7_3X8hYz"><p>Artichoke Leaf extract is primarily recognized for its potent digestive and liver-supporting properties. It stimulates the production and flow of bile, a digestive fluid essential for the breakdown and absorption of fats and fat-soluble vitamins. This improved bile flow can alleviate indigestion, bloating, and other digestive discomforts, promoting smoother digestion after meals.</p></div>
<div class="ingredients-sidebar-table-template--23755308663113__ss_product_ingredients_7_3X8hYz">
<div class="ingredients-sidebar-table-item-template--23755308663113__ss_product_ingredients_7_3X8hYz">
<p class="ingredients-sidebar-heading-template--23755308663113__ss_product_ingredients_7_3X8hYz" style="margin-top: 0 !important;">EFFECTIVE DOSAGE</p>
<div class="ingredients-sidebar-text-template--23755308663113__ss_product_ingredients_7_3X8hYz"><p>300-600mg (standardized extract)</p></div>
</div>
<div class="ingredients-sidebar-table-item-template--23755308663113__ss_product_ingredients_7_3X8hYz">
<p class="ingredients-sidebar-heading-template--23755308663113__ss_product_ingredients_7_3X8hYz" style="margin-top: 0 !important;">GENERAL USE</p>
<div class="ingredients-sidebar-text-template--23755308663113__ss_product_ingredients_7_3X8hYz"><p>100-1200mg (raw powder to extract)</p></div>
</div>
</div>
<p class="ingredients-sidebar-heading-template--23755308663113__ss_product_ingredients_7_3X8hYz">THE SCIENCE</p>
<div class="ingredients-sidebar-text-template--23755308663113__ss_product_ingredients_7_3X8hYz"><p>Furthermore, Artichoke Leaf contains compounds like cynarin and chlorogenic acid, which possess antioxidant properties and support liver health. By aiding the liver's bile production, it also indirectly assists in detoxification processes. Its comprehensive benefits for digestive comfort and liver function make it an excellent ingredient for enhancing overall gut health and systemic balance.</p></div>
</div>
<div class="ingredients-modal-content-template--23755308663113__ss_product_ingredients_7_3X8hYz" data-id="card_6NqC7X">
<div class="ingredients-sidebar-title-template--23755308663113__ss_product_ingredients_7_3X8hYz">Lion's Mane</div>
<div class="ingredients-sidebar-subtext-template--23755308663113__ss_product_ingredients_7_3X8hYz"><p>Fighting inflammation</p></div>
<div class="ingredients-sidebar-image-template--23755308663113__ss_product_ingredients_7_3X8hYz">
<img height="1001" loading="eager" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 100vw, 100vw" src="//section.store/cdn/shop/files/101320.jpg?v=1748282404&amp;width=1500" srcset="//section.store/cdn/shop/files/101320.jpg?v=1748282404&amp;width=375 375w, //section.store/cdn/shop/files/101320.jpg?v=1748282404&amp;width=550 550w, //section.store/cdn/shop/files/101320.jpg?v=1748282404&amp;width=750 750w, //section.store/cdn/shop/files/101320.jpg?v=1748282404&amp;width=1100 1100w, //section.store/cdn/shop/files/101320.jpg?v=1748282404&amp;width=1500 1500w" width="1500"/>
</div>
<p class="ingredients-sidebar-heading-template--23755308663113__ss_product_ingredients_7_3X8hYz" style="border: 0px !important;">WHAT IS IT?</p>
<div class="ingredients-sidebar-text-template--23755308663113__ss_product_ingredients_7_3X8hYz"><p>Lion's Mane Mushroom is a revered functional mushroom, increasingly recognized for its neurotrophic properties. It contains compounds like hericenones and erinacines, which are believed to stimulate the production of Nerve Growth Factor (NGF) in the brain. NGF plays a crucial role in the growth, maintenance, and survival of neurons, supporting overall brain health and cognitive function.</p></div>
<div class="ingredients-sidebar-table-template--23755308663113__ss_product_ingredients_7_3X8hYz">
<div class="ingredients-sidebar-table-item-template--23755308663113__ss_product_ingredients_7_3X8hYz">
<p class="ingredients-sidebar-heading-template--23755308663113__ss_product_ingredients_7_3X8hYz" style="margin-top: 0 !important;">EFFECTIVE DOSAGE</p>
<div class="ingredients-sidebar-text-template--23755308663113__ss_product_ingredients_7_3X8hYz"><p>500-1500mg (extract)</p></div>
</div>
<div class="ingredients-sidebar-table-item-template--23755308663113__ss_product_ingredients_7_3X8hYz">
<p class="ingredients-sidebar-heading-template--23755308663113__ss_product_ingredients_7_3X8hYz" style="margin-top: 0 !important;">GENERAL USE</p>
<div class="ingredients-sidebar-text-template--23755308663113__ss_product_ingredients_7_3X8hYz"><p>250-3000mg (powder or extract)</p></div>
</div>
</div>
<p class="ingredients-sidebar-heading-template--23755308663113__ss_product_ingredients_7_3X8hYz">THE SCIENCE</p>
<div class="ingredients-sidebar-text-template--23755308663113__ss_product_ingredients_7_3X8hYz"><p>This unique mushroom is often included in supplements aimed at enhancing memory, focus, and overall mental clarity. Its potential to support neuronal health makes it a valuable ingredient for anyone looking to maintain or improve cognitive vitality and nervous system well-being as they age.</p></div>
</div>
