<p class="ingredients-sidebar-heading-template--23755308663113__ss_product_ingredients_7_3X8hYz" style="border: 0px !important;">WHAT IS IT?</p>
<div class="ingredients-sidebar-text-template--23755308663113__ss_product_ingredients_7_3X8hYz"><p>Coenzyme Q10 (CoQ10) is a naturally occurring antioxidant essential for cellular energy production, particularly in the heart and other high-energy organs. As we age, our natural CoQ10 levels tend to decline, which can impact cellular function. Our Wellness Supplement provides CoQ10 to support your body's vital energy processes, ensuring cells have the fuel they need to perform optimally.</p></div>
<div class="ingredients-sidebar-table-template--23755308663113__ss_product_ingredients_7_3X8hYz">
<div class="ingredients-sidebar-table-item-template--23755308663113__ss_product_ingredients_7_3X8hYz">
<p class="ingredients-sidebar-heading-template--23755308663113__ss_product_ingredients_7_3X8hYz" style="margin-top: 0 !important;">EFFECTIVE DOSAGE</p>
