</div>
<div class="ingredients-sidebar-table-item-template--23755308663113__ss_product_ingredients_7_3X8hYz">
<p class="ingredients-sidebar-heading-template--23755308663113__ss_product_ingredients_7_3X8hYz" style="margin-top: 0 !important;">GENERAL USE</p>
<div class="ingredients-sidebar-text-template--23755308663113__ss_product_ingredients_7_3X8hYz"><p>50-400mg</p></div>
</div>
</div>
<p class="ingredients-sidebar-heading-template--23755308663113__ss_product_ingredients_7_3X8hYz">THE SCIENCE</p>
<div class="ingredients-sidebar-text-template--23755308663113__ss_product_ingredients_7_3X8hYz"><p>Beyond its role in energy metabolism, CoQ10 is a powerful antioxidant, protecting cells from damage caused by free radicals. This protective action is particularly beneficial for cardiovascular health, as it helps maintain the integrity of blood vessels and supports overall heart function. Its anti-aging benefits extend to cellular health throughout the entire body, contributing to long-term vitality.</p></div>
</div>
