</div>
<p class="ingredients-sidebar-heading-template--23755308663113__ss_product_ingredients_7_3X8hYz" style="border: 0px !important;">WHAT IS IT?</p>
<div class="ingredients-sidebar-text-template--23755308663113__ss_product_ingredients_7_3X8hYz"><p>L-Theanine, an amino acid predominantly found in green tea, is a unique addition to our Wellness Supplement due to its calming yet non-drowsy effects. It promotes relaxation by increasing alpha brain wave activity, which is associated with a state of alert relaxation, similar to what is experienced during meditation. This allows for a reduction in feelings of anxiety and nervousness without impairing cognitive function.</p></div>
<div class="ingredients-sidebar-table-template--23755308663113__ss_product_ingredients_7_3X8hYz">
