<p class="ingredients-sidebar-heading-template--23755308663113__ss_product_ingredients_7_3X8hYz">THE SCIENCE</p>
<div class="ingredients-sidebar-text-template--23755308663113__ss_product_ingredients_7_3X8hYz"><p>In addition to its anxiolytic properties, L-Theanine also supports improved focus and attention. By promoting a more relaxed and centered state of mind, it can help filter out distractions and enhance concentration, making it easier to engage in tasks requiring mental acuity. This combination of calm and clarity makes L-Theanine an invaluable ingredient for daily mental well-being.</p></div>
